"--\n"
"An index of application classes which is built from archives and dependencies that contain a certain marker file. These files include but are not limited to - beans.xml, jandex.idx and config properties. Additional marker files can be declared via `AdditionalApplicationArchiveMarkerBuildItem` . Alternatively, you can index a dependency through `IndexDependencyBuildItem` . Compared to `BeanArchiveIndexBuildItem` , this index doesn't contain all CDI-related information. On the other hand, it can contain classes from archives/dependencies that had no CDI component declared within them. The computing index can also be used to index classes on demand, when `IndexView#getClassByName(DotName)` is called. Note that this is a mutable index as this will add additional information, so in general this Index should only be used if you actually need it.\n"
